    "The skill consistently produces YAML front matter (3/3) vs baseline using old >> style (0/3)",
    "The skill correctly uses CookLang sections for multi-phase recipes (milk bread) but both versions skip sections for simpler recipes — this is arguably correct behavior for pad thai and bourguignon",
